IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0006.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 LOAN-TO-VALUE      PIC 9(3).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 MORT-INS-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> RATE ADJUSTMENT
    05 RATE-ADJ           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM MORTGAGE-INS-CHECK
    DISPLAY "MORT-INS-IND=" MORT-INS-IND
    DISPLAY "RATE-ADJ=" RATE-ADJ
    STOP RUN.
MORTGAGE-INS-CHECK.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIREMENT
    IF LOAN-TO-VALUE > 90
        MOVE 'Y' TO MORT-INS-IND
        MOVE 0.0050 TO RATE-ADJ
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MORT-INS-IND
    END-IF.
